Removed in pliman 4.0.0
  The Line Segment Detector (LSD, src/lsd.c) and the sub-pixel contour
  detector (src/smooth_contours.c) by Rafael Grompone von Gioi, both
  distributed under the GNU Affero General Public License, were removed.
  image_line_segment() and image_contour_line() are defunct.

Pre-trained models (not distributed with pliman)
  The deep learning models used by pliman are downloaded at run time from
  third-party sources and keep their own licenses, which are not the GPL.
  Several forbid commercial use (e.g. BRIA RMBG 1.4 / 2.0, YOLO-NAS weights)
  and others are AGPL-3.0 (Ultralytics YOLO26 and YOLO-World weights). The
  models are provided for research and non-commercial use only. See
  inst/MODEL_LICENSES.md (system.file("MODEL_LICENSES.md", package = "pliman")).
